Story points: 3.', '1', NULL, '', 'pm@northbridge.example.com', '[]', '[]', '', '2026-05-26T12:00:00.000Z', '2026-05-26T12:00:00.000Z'),
  ('100014', 'PROJ-14', 'PROJ', '10002', 'Case cracks at the corner and leaves a sharp edge', 'SKU NB-CASE-R4 (rugged phone case); supplier Quanzhou MoldRight.
Severity: Major. Affected units: 200 (out of a 4000-unit production run). Regulatory status: not reportable.
Symptom: The frame cracks at one corner under a modest knock, and the break leaves a jagged edge that has nicked fingers when the phone is pulled out.
Root cause: the corner wall is moulded too thin and splits along the gate line.
Story points: 4.', '1', NULL, '', 'pm@northbridge.example.com', '[]', '[]', '', '2026-05-26T13:00:00.000Z', '2026-05-26T13:00:00.000Z'),
  ('100015', 'PROJ-15', 'PROJ', '10002', 'Dashcam can overheat severely after sitting in a hot car', 'SKU NB-DASHCAM-D4 (dashboard camera); supplier Hangzhou RoadEye.
Severity: Critical. Affected units: 60 (out of a 2000-unit production run). Regulatory status: not reportable.
Symptom: Left on the windscreen of a car parked in direct sun, the unit can get hot enough inside to char its own housing and scorch the trim it rests on, even with the engine off.
Root cause: the internal cell turns thermally unstable at the temperatures reached during heat-soak in this early batch.
Story points: 5.', '1', NULL, '', 'pm@northbridge.example.com', '[]', '[]', '', '2026-05-26T14:00:00.000Z', '2026-05-26T14:00:00.000Z'),
  ('100016', 'PROJ-16', 'PROJ', '10002', 'Gimbal grip can deliver a jolt while charging', 'SKU NB-GIMBAL-G2 (phone gimbal); supplier Suzhou SteadyShot.
